            status: "general", src: "Rest. (2d) Judgments §§17-19, 24; FRCP 41(b); Federated Dep't Stores, Inc. v. Moitie, 452 U.S. 394 (1981); Lucky Brand Dungarees, Inc. v. Marcel Fashions Group, Inc., 590 U.S. 405 (2020); civpro.md §15.1",
