            stem: "A plaintiff sued a corporation in a federal court in State X on a contract claim. The court dismissed the action for lack of personal jurisdiction over the corporation. The plaintiff then filed the same claim against the corporation in a federal court in State Y, where the corporation is subject to personal jurisdiction. The corporation moved to dismiss on the ground of claim preclusion.",
