            stem: "A defendant was acquitted of arson in a state criminal prosecution after a jury trial. The owner of the burned building, who had testified for the prosecution, later sued the defendant in federal court for damages for the fire, alleging that the defendant set it. The defendant moved for summary judgment, arguing that the acquittal conclusively established that he did not set the fire.",
