            stem: "A federal court sitting in diversity in State X dismissed a plaintiff's state-law contract claim as barred by State X's statute of limitations. The order did not say whether the dismissal was with or without prejudice. The plaintiff refiled the same claim in a State Y court, where a longer limitations period would allow it. The defendant argues claim preclusion.",
