            stem: "A plaintiff sued two defendants in a single federal action. The district court granted summary judgment for the first defendant on all claims against it and entered no determination under Rule 54(b). Claims against the second defendant remain pending. Ten days later, the plaintiff filed a notice of appeal from the summary judgment.",
